{
  "id": "31828_raikou",
  "headword": "{来航|らいこう}",
  "reading": "らいこう",
  "romaji": "raikou",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "arrival by ship (from overseas)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "arrival by ship from overseas",
      "explanation": "Coming to a country by sea, used above all of foreign ships arriving in Japan. Best known from ペリー{来航|らいこう}, Commodore Perry's arrival in 1853."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "31828_raikou_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{黒船|くろふね}→黒船：14710_kurofune⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{来航|らいこう}⟦した→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "The Black Ships arrived.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31828_raikou_ex2",
      "japanese": "ペリー⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧1853⟦{年|ねん}→年：09876_nen⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{来航|らいこう}⟦した→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "Perry arrived by ship in 1853.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31828_raikou_ex3",
      "japanese": "ペリー{来航|らいこう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦きっかけ→きっかけ：10309_kikkake⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧、⟦{日本|にほん}→日本：03876_nihon⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{開国|かいこく}→開国：14660_kaikoku⟧⟦へ→へ：02473_he⟧⟦{向|む}かった→向かう：01186_mukau⟧。",
      "english": "Perry's arrival set Japan on the road to opening the country.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A written, historical word; for a ship arriving at a port today, ⟦{入港|にゅうこう}→入港：14771_nyuukou⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ is the usual verb.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ペリー{来航|らいこう}: Perry's arrival (1853)\n- ⟦{黒船|くろふね}→黒船：14710_kurofune⟧{来航|らいこう}: the arrival of the Black Ships\n- {浦賀|うらが}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{来航|らいこう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to arrive at Uraga by sea\n- {外国船|がいこくせん}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{来航|らいこう}: the arrival of foreign ships",
